# The SHA-256 of every file in the Packages directory of a retail Mac OS X
# 10.6 Snow Leopard install DVD, one disc per "# build" section. The plugin
# never downloads a disc: the user supplies an image of their own, and
# installmedia.Check holds the volume inside it to these values, so any
# faithful copy passes whatever tool made the image.
#
# build 10A432 (10.6.0 retail): read 2026-10-04 inside the privops microVM
# (assets/privops/verify-disc.sh) from an ISO of 7,771,521,024 bytes, sha256
# cbeeb2378c40b20a9b06236f567de593e9030a0a865515b50cf6d35833e25cd5, whose
# HFS+ volume starts at byte 1,034,489,856; BSD.pkg, OSInstall.mpkg and
# AddressBook.pkg read again on the host with 7-Zip, which shares no code
# with the Linux hfsplus driver, and agreed.
#
# A disc of another build is added as its own section once one has been
# read the same way.
#
